      "writtenOn": "2020-12-14T16:50:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am not sure why this is a hack. It would be nice if it could just use PathForModuleOut() but it cannot because TopDownMutatorContext does not provide the ModuleSubDir() method that PathForModuleOut() requires. Adding that method would require changes to blueprint which I wanted to avoid.\n\nThe path cannot be created during GenerateAndroidBuildActions because the path is needed by the GenerateAndroidBuildActions for the java_import modules which are run first due to the dependency ordering.\n\nObviously, if the dependency was reversed then it would not be a problem but I address that in an earlier comment.",
